    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Trees - in-place rewiring</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Preorder</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/flatten-binary-tree-to-linked-list/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 114</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Flatten Binary Tree to Linked List</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Turn the tree into a right-only chain in preorder, reusing the nodes. Three ways: collect the preorder and relink (O(n) memory), recurse in reverse preorder (right, left, root) linking each node to the one built before it, or walk down the right spine and, at each node with a left subtree, hang its right subtree on the left subtree's rightmost node. The last one is O(n) time and O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
  },
